00:01:31.740 --> 00:01:36.439
Trump eliminated the debt five and a half
months into his tenure as president, according

00:01:36.439 --> 00:01:37.720
to the documents.

00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:42.100
He seems to have acted with urgency to wipe
the liability off his balance sheet from 2011

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:43.560
to 2016.

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:49.579
The balance stayed static at 19.8 million
paperwork capturing Trump's financial picture

00:01:49.579 --> 00:01:55.670
as of June 30, 2017, five months into his
presidency, appear to show the balance dropped

00:01:55.670 --> 00:01:57.659
to 4.3 million.

00:01:57.659 --> 00:01:59.100
Trump got rid of the debt altogether.

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:04.979
Shortly after that, Daewoo was bought out
of its position on July five, 2017.

00:02:04.979 --> 00:02:07.750
Doesn't say who paid off the loan.

00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:13.500
Although the debt appeared on the Trump Organization's
